PART 7 — GLOBAL HINT SYSTEM
==================================================

NON-NEGOTIABLE HACKATHON TWIST.

Each complete campaign run has exactly TWO hints.

The player must never receive more than two hints for that escape.

This means:

Campaign 01:
Two hints across all three puzzles.

Campaign 02:
Two hints across all three puzzles.

Campaign 03:
Two hints across all three puzzles.

The hint count is independent between campaigns.

Within one campaign:
- Start at 2/2.
- First request changes it to 1/2.
- Second request changes it to 0/2.
- Third request is rejected.

The counter must never reset between puzzles.

Display:

HINTS AVAILABLE: 2/2.

When both are consumed:

THIRD HINT UNAVAILABLE.

"You have used all your available hints. Think carefully."

The hint system must be centrally managed.

Hints must be contextual and indirect.

Do not reveal complete puzzle solutions.

The investigation board and item descriptions must not secretly function as additional hints.

The judge must be able to verify this behavior explicitly.

